  "bio": "Elric Gordon is a masterful tattoo artist based in Melbourne, Australia, specializing in black & gray and realism styles. Recognized and followed by approximately 60,000 passionate fans on Instagram, his work truly stands out for its compelling depth and meticulous detail. His artwork showcases a captivating fusion of imagery and emotions, making each tattoo a unique and personal masterpiece.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location:\n\n𝙼𝚎𝚕𝚋𝚘𝚞𝚛𝚗𝚎, 𝙰𝚞𝚜𝚝𝚛𝚊𝚕𝚒𝚊\n@theblackmarktattoo\n-\n𝐁𝐨𝐨𝐤𝐢𝐧𝐠𝐬 \n𝚎𝚕𝚛𝚒𝚌𝚐𝚘𝚛𝚍𝚘𝚗𝚝𝚊𝚝𝚝𝚘𝚘@𝚐𝚖𝚊𝚒𝚕.𝚌𝚘𝚖\n-\n𝐅𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧-𝐃𝐫.𝐏𝐢𝐜𝐤𝐥𝐞𝐬-𝐋𝐨𝐭𝐮𝐬-𝐓𝐚𝐭𝐭𝐨𝐨𝐚𝐫𝐦𝐨𝐮𝐫-𝐆𝐡𝐨𝐬𝐭𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐞\n-\n🖤 𝑆𝑎𝑟𝑎",
